<title>USA: Roberds same-stores sales off 9.3 pct.</title>
<headline>Roberds same-stores sales off 9.3 pct.</headline>
<dateline>DAYTON, Ohio 1996-11-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Roberds Inc Monday reported sales for October and the first 10 months of the year.</p>
<p>	     Sales in millions of dollars     Percent change</p>
<p>		    1996	 1995	     Total     Same-Store</p>
<p>Month		$30.8	$26.1     +18.2	 -9.3</p>
<p>Year-to-date    $269.2     $241.9     +11.3	 -8.2</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212-859-1610.</p>
</text>
